{"answerArea":{"calculator":false,"chi2Table":false,"periodicTable":false,"tTable":false,"zTable":false},"hints":[{"content":"$\\begin{align}\\left(\\dfrac{z^{12}}{z^{10}}\\right)^3\u0026= \\left(\\dfrac{z^{12}}{z^{10}}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\dfrac{z^{12}}{z^{10}}\\right)\\cdot\\left(\\dfrac{z^{12}}{z^{10}}\\right)\\\\\n\\\\\n \u0026= \\left(z^{12-10}\\right) \\cdot \\left(z^{12-10}\\right) \\cdot \\left(z^{12-10}\\right)\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026=\\left(z^2\\right) \\cdot \\left(z^2\\right) \\cdot \\left(z^2\\right)  \\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026=z^{2+2+2}\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026=z^6\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026\\neq z^8\n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align} \\left(z\\cdot z^3\\right)^2\u0026=\\left(z\\cdot z^3\\right) \\cdot \\left(z\\cdot z^3\\right) \\\\\n\\\\ \n\u0026=\\left(z^{1+3}\\right) \\cdot  \\left(z^{1+3}\\right)\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026=z^4 \\cdot z^4\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026=z^{4+4}\\\\\n\\\\\n \u0026\\stackrel\\checkmark=z^{8}  \\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align} z^6 \\cdot z^2\u0026=z^{6+2} \\\\\n\\\\ \n \u0026\\stackrel\\checkmark= z^{8}  \\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align}\\dfrac{z^{16}}{z^2}\u0026= z^{16-2}\\\\\n\\\\\n \u0026\\neq z^{8} \n\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"$\\begin{align} \\left(\\dfrac{z^{6}}{z}\\right)^2 \u0026=  \\left(\\dfrac{z^{6}}{z}\\right) \\cdot  \\left(\\dfrac{z^{6}}{z}\\right)\\\\\n\\\\\n \u0026=\\left(z^{6-1}\\right)\\cdot \\left(z^{6-1}\\right)\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026=z^5 \\cdot z^5\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026=z^{10}\\\\\n\\\\\n\u0026\\neq z^{8}\\end{align}$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}},{"content":"The following two expressions are equivalent to $z^{8}$:    \n\n$\\left(z\\cdot z^3\\right)^2$\n\n$z^6 \\cdot z^2$","images":{},"replace":false,"widgets":{}}],"itemDataVersion":{"major":0,"minor":1},"question":{"content":"**Select the two expressions that are equivalent to $z^{8}$.**\n\n[[☃ radio 1